   "source": [
    "Insight: \n",
    "By separating movies and TV shows, we can clearly see that while both grew significantly from the year 2008 and 2020, the addition of movies accelerated more dramatically, especially in the year 2019. The growth in the TV shows has been more steady. There appears to be slight shutdown in content additions in the year 2020 and 2021, which could be due to the peak of COVID-19 at that time which might affect the productions or maybe the dataset could be incomplete for the latest years."
   ]
