   "source": [
    "Insight:\n",
    "The large spike at 0 indicates that the significant amount of content is being added in the same year, which is the characteristic of the \"Netflix Originals\". However, there is a very long tail, showing that Netflix also heavily invests in acquiring licensed content that can be decaded old, building a deep library of classic movies and TV shows."
